// OilRig APT Activity | T1053.005, T1071.004, T1112, T1543.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2018/TA/OilRig/proc_creation_win_apt_oilrig_mar18.yml
(process.command_line:*SC\ Scheduled\ Scan* AND process.command_line:*\\microsoft\\Taskbar\\autoit3.exe*) OR (process.executable.caseless:*\\Windows\\Temp\\DB\\* AND process.executable.caseless:*.exe) OR (process.executable.caseless:C\:\\Windows\\system32\\Service.exe AND (process.command_line:(*i* OR *u*))) OR (process.parent.executable.caseless:*\\local\\microsoft\\Taskbar\\autoit3.exe AND (process.command_line:*nslookup.exe* AND process.command_line:*\-q\=TXT*))
